{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>שפך</b> — connected to what precedes it, as in <i>יפלו</i> (may they fall). <i>שפך עליהם</i> (pour upon them) — above, [meaning] Your wrath, so that if they flee, the heat of Your anger will overtake them; as they will not escape, their stronghold will be destroyed."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 69, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:28.559175522Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}